TEXT 920 -616 Left 2 ;Rfe: U1N*U1N/(p0*SN1) Rfe: U1N*U1N/(p0*SN1) U1N=phase voltage SN1=one phase power\nRfe: 230940*230940/(0.0004*100e6)=1.333e6 -> Pfe=120kW iron lost (p0*SN=0.0004*300e6)\n \nRphis: N*N/X1s*omega=N*N/L1s -> higher Rphis = lower leakage\nRphis:640*640/53.33*314.159=~2.41e6
